Read `plan.md` and `GLOSSARY.md` before implementing install or marketplace parsing logic.

Use Cursor-aligned terms: **plugin** / **plugin entry**, not “bundle” in operator-facing text. Scope defaults are in `plan.md`. Project scope uses `.agents/skills`; `--global` is user scope. Installed-plugins ledger: `.ivcota/installed-bundles.json` in the target project cwd (even for user scope).

Do not duplicate skill lists from `Ivcota/skills` marketplace.json in this repo. Parse the catalog at install time.

Phase 1 is skills-cli only. Do not add Cursor marketplace publish or `install_plugin` integration until Phase 2 in plan.md.
